{"id":"n83480-1-10","stage":4,"title":"직거래 · 直接交易","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83480-1-10-1","ko":"이거 어디서 샀는지 물건이 좋아 보여.","zh":"这东西看起来真不错，是在哪儿买的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"어디서","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디서","audio":"/audio/2239e13aeeae3639dd35.mp3"}},{"text":"샀는지","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀는지","audio":"/audio/5bdda97e97dc56ccdd29.mp3"}},{"text":"물건이","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건이","audio":"/audio/467d4d94d33d4871f929.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보여","audio":"/audio/f30cd240679cd06f7fad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3b41be2927c9981e265d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83480-1-10-2","ko":"동네 바자회에서 직거래로 산 거야.","zh":"是在社区义卖会上直接从卖家那里买的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}},{"text":"바자회에서","meaning":"慈善会，义卖会","explanation":"바자회：慈善会，义卖会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"바자회","audio":"/audio/4bd75a347f764d113c43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57547","senseId":"1","lemma":"바자회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바자회에서","audio":"/audio/a4bc2c3a3fd548a74e46.mp3"}},{"text":"직거래로","meaning":"直接交易，直销","explanation":"직거래：直接交易，直销；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"직거래","audio":"/audio/273078e98cc9aaaec4cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83480","senseId":"1","lemma":"직거래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직거래로","audio":"/audio/8fa548d0280b65538598.mp3"}},{"text":"산","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"4bd75a347f764d11","term":"바자회","zh":"慈善会，义卖会","audio":"/audio/4bd75a347f764d113c43.mp3","entryId":"57547","definition":"为了募集用于慈善事业或社会事业等的资金而开设的市场。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"273078e98cc9aaae","term":"직거래","zh":"直接交易，直销","audio":"/audio/273078e98cc9aaaec4cc.mp3","entryId":"83480","definition":"指销售商品时，交易双方不经过中介人而直接交易。","pronunciation":["직꺼래"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a33560d2ef9c300c15b2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83480","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这东西看起来真不错，是在哪儿买的呀？","是在社区义卖会上直接从卖家那里买的。","什么时候需要用敬语呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这东西看起来真不错，是在哪儿买的呀？","是在社区义卖会上直接从卖家那里买的。","什么时候需要用敬语呢？"],"answer":1}]}
